<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Please change your {{ attack.target.company }} account password</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#eef2f7; font-family:'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; color:#1f2937;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#eef2f7; padding:24px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px; width:100%; background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);">

          <tr>
            <td style="background:#0b3d91; padding:24px 32px;" align="left">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td valign="middle" style="padding-right:14px;" width="64">
                    <img src="{{ settings.cast.url }}/hii_change_password/thumbnail-ci-Photoroom.png"
                         alt="สถาบันสารสนเทศทรัพยากรน้ำ"
                         width="56" height="56"
                         style="display:block; width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:8px; background:#ffffff; padding:4px;">
                  </td>
                  <td valign="middle">
                    <div style="color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2;">
                      สถาบันสารสนเทศทรัพยากรน้ำ (องค์การมหาชน)
                    </div>
                    <div style="color:#bcd0f5; font-size:13px; margin-top:2px;">
                      ICT Team &middot; Account Security Notice
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="background:#fff7ed; border-left:4px solid #f59e0b; padding:12px 32px;">
              <span style="color:#92400e; font-size:13px; font-weight:600;">
                &#9888; Action required &middot; กำหนดเปลี่ยนรหัสผ่านก่อน 28 Jan 2026
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px;">

              <h1 style="margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#0f172a; font-size:22px; font-weight:600;">
                Please change your {{ attack.target.company }} account password
              </h1>
              <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0; color:#64748b; font-size:13px;">
                ICT Security Policy &middot; Mandatory password rotation
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#1f2937;">
                Dear <strong>{{ attack.target.name }}</strong>,
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#1f2937;">
                According to our new security policy, all <strong>{{ attack.target.company }}</strong> staff
                must change their password every <strong>6 months</strong>.
                Follow the steps below to change your {{ attack.target.company }} account password.
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                     style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:8px; margin:0 0 24px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:16px 20px;">
                    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td width="32" valign="top" style="color:#0b3d91; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; padding:6px 0;">1.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-size:14px; color:#334155; line-height:1.6; padding:6px 0;">
                          Go to <a href="{{ templates.url }}" style="color:#0b3d91; font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline;">this page</a>.
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td width="32" valign="top" style="color:#0b3d91; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; padding:6px 0;">2.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-size:14px; color:#334155; line-height:1.6; padding:6px 0;">
                          Enter your old password.
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td width="32" valign="top" style="color:#0b3d91; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; padding:6px 0;">3.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-size:14px; color:#334155; line-height:1.6; padding:6px 0;">
                          Enter your new password.
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td width="32" valign="top" style="color:#0b3d91; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; padding:6px 0;">4.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-size:14px; color:#334155; line-height:1.6; padding:6px 0;">
                          Confirm your new password.
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td width="32" valign="top" style="color:#0b3d91; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; padding:6px 0;">5.</td>
                        <td valign="top" style="font-size:14px; color:#334155; line-height:1.6; padding:6px 0;">
                          Click <strong>&ldquo;Submit&rdquo;</strong>.
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">
                    <a href="{{ templates.url }}"
                       style="display:inline-block; background:#0b3d91; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;
                              padding:14px 32px; border-radius:6px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;
                              letter-spacing:0.3px;">
                      Change Password Now
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#1f2937;">
                Please be reminded that all staff must change their password before
                <strong>28 Jan 2026</strong>. If your password is already expired,
                please contact the ICT support team.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#64748b;">
                *You will be automatically logged out of your account on all devices after this process.
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#64748b;">
                **If you are not logged out automatically, please manually log out to allow the process to complete.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:14px; color:#1f2937;">
                Thank you for taking your time to keep our organization secure.
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#1f2937; font-weight:600;">
                &mdash; ICT Team
              </p>

              <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; margin:24px 0 16px 0;">

              <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#94a3b8; word-break:break-all;">
                [1]
                <a href="{{ templates.url }}" style="color:#94a3b8; text-decoration:underline;">{{ templates.url }}</a>
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="background:#0f172a; padding:18px 32px; text-align:center;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0; color:#e2e8f0; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;">
                สถาบันสารสนเทศทรัพยากรน้ำ (องค์การมหาชน)
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0; color:#94a3b8; font-size:11px;">
                Hydro &amp; Agro Informatics Institute &middot; ICT Department<br>
                This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
